0
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,910
<v Narrator>The American Midwestern town, Raccoon City, has been completely decimated due to the

0
00:00:04,960 --> 00:00:10,160
<v Narrator>T-Virus outbreak that was instigated by the international corporation, Umbrella.

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,550
<v Narrator>Claire Redfield, who arrived in Raccoon City to search for her lost brother, Chris,

1
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:09,430
<v Narrator>and her rookie police officer, Leon S. Kennedy, managed to escape from the city,

1
00:00:09,480 --> 00:00:14,580
<v Narrator>but their ordeal was only a prelude of things to come.

2
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,320
<v Narrator>Three months later.

17
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
Perfect.

18
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,320
<v Rodrigo>Go on. Get out of here. This place is finished.

18
00:00:05,160 --> 00:00:08,720
<v Rodrigo>I don't know. It might have been a special forces team.

18
00:00:09,080 --> 00:00:11,830
<v Rodrigo>But in any case, this prison's been taken over.

18
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:14,120
<v Rodrigo>Our troops have been wiped out.

19
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>What are you saying?

20
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,940
<v Rodrigo>You're free to leave the complex.

21
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,020
<v Rodrigo>But you may as well know you have no chance of getting off this island.

22
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
<v Claire>And what about you? What are you going to do?

24
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,280
<v Rodrigo>Don't worry about me.

25
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,078
<v Claire>No!

28
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,560
<v Steve>Wait, wait! Don't shoot!

29
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>Who are you?

30
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,420
<v Steve>Huh? You're not a zombie?

31
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,989
<v Claire>Well, great!

32
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Steve>Wait right there!

33
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Steve>I'm coming over!

34
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,130
<v Steve>Uh, sorry about that little misunderstanding, but I thought you were another one of

34
00:00:04,180 --> 00:00:05,380
<v Steve>those monsters.

35
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,084
<v Claire>Shut up.

36
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,740
<v Claire>Make one wrong move and I'll shoot!

37
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,220
<v Steve>Relax, beautiful.

38
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Steve>I said I was sorry.

39
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Steve>My name's Steve.

40
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,460
<v Steve>I was a prisoner on this island.

41
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,780
<v Steve>And I'm guessing you're not from Umbrella either.

42
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,660
<v Claire>No, I'm Claire. Claire Redfield.

43
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,194
<v Steve>Claire.

45
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,050
<v Steve>Nice.

46
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Steve>I'll remember that.

47
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,999
<v Steve>Hey!

48
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,760
<v Steve>I heard there's an airport around here.

49
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,380
<v Steve>Once I find it, I can finally escape from this crazy island!

50
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,101
<v Steve>Well, I'll see ya.

51
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>Hey, wait up!

52
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,880
<v Steve>I don't want you following me, lady!

53
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,220
<v Steve>You'll only slow me down.

56
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>What are you doing here?

57
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,840
<v Steve>Chris Redfield. Is he a relative of yours or something?

58
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>You mean my brother?

60
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Steve>Your siblings.

61
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,820
<v Steve>Well, it seems your brother is under surveillance by Umbrella.

62
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,195
<v Claire>What?

63
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,720
<v Claire>I've got to contact Leon and tell him to let my brother know he's being monitored.

64
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,180
<v Claire>It's a good thing I have access to an outside connection from here.

65
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,700
<v Steve>Well, that file shows the latitude and longitude of this place.

66
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,460
<v Steve>Why don't you send your brother the coordinates and ask him to come help?

67
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,720
<v Claire>Thanks, I'll do that.

68
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,680
<v Steve>Hey! I was just kidding!

69
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,700
<v Steve>There's no way he could get here, even if he is your brother.

70
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,760
<v Claire>Yes, he can. I'm sure of it.

71
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,160
<v Steve>You'll just end up disappointed if you rely on others.

72
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,340
<v Steve>Believe me, I know!

73
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Steve>No way.

74
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Steve>He won't come.

75
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,580
<v Claire>What was that all about?

76
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,240
<v Claire>I can't get the door open!

80
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,480
<v Claire>That was close.

86
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,080
<v Steve>Yeah! Help me!

90
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>Steve?

92
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,650
<v Steve>That was too close. But I found something, thanks to

92
00:00:05,700 --> 00:00:06,900
<v Steve>you.

93
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Steve>Looks cool, huh?

94
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,440
<v Steve>Huh. Thought I wouldn't... make it.

95
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>Oh, I need those.

96
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>Give them to me.

97
00:00:01,860 --> 00:00:03,080
<v Steve>I made it!

98
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,840
<v Steve>Huh, that was too close.

99
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Steve>What took you so long?

101
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,740
<v Steve>Fine.

102
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,240
<v Steve>But let's make a deal.

103
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,740
<v Steve>I'll trade you for something fully automatic.

104
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,129
<v Steve>Fine.

105
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Steve>Let's make a deal.

106
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,420
<v Steve>I'll trade you for something fully automatic.

107
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,240
<v Steve>You gotta be kidding.

108
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,680
<v Steve>I found it and I'm keeping it!

111
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Steve>I'll see you around, Claire!

112
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Steve>Adios!

113
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>Hey, wait! Steve!

115
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,160
<v Alfred>Redfield! How dare you interfere with my operation!

116
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,620
<v Claire>What are you talking about?

117
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,500
<v Alfred>You let yourself be captured so you could lead your people to this base!

118
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,790
<v Claire>I have no idea what you're babbling about!

118
00:00:02,840 --> 00:00:04,900
<v Alfred>You don't fool me!

118
00:00:05,770 --> 00:00:10,700
<v Alfred>I am Alfred Ashford, commander of this base!

120
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,290
<v Claire>Oh? You must be one of Umbrella's lower level officers if you're in command of a

120
00:00:04,340 --> 00:00:06,100
<v Claire>backwater base like this one.

121
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,340
<v Alfred>How dare you!

122
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,320
<v Alfred>The Ashford family is among the world's first and finest.

123
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,180
<v Alfred>My grandfather is one of the original founders of Umbrella Inc.

124
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,380
<v Alfred>Now tell me, why have you attacked this installation?

125
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
<v Claire>Attacked!

126
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,320
<v Alfred>Shortly after you arrived, my base was attacked.

126
00:00:03,520 --> 00:00:06,520
<v Alfred>You must have informed your people of its location.

127
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,880
<v Claire>I still don't follow you. I really don't know anything about that!

128
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,430
<v Alfred>Unacceptable! How can you deny it? My base has been

128
00:00:05,480 --> 00:00:11,330
<v Alfred>destroyed, and thanks to you, the experimental T-Virus was released, creating

128
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:14,320
<v Alfred>countless zombies and monsters.

129
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,120
<v Alfred>Tell me, who do you work for? Who sent you?

130
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,810
<v Alfred>Ha ha ha! Have it your way then! You're just a rat in a cage

130
00:00:05,860 --> 00:00:07,060
<v Alfred>anyway!

130
00:00:07,340 --> 00:00:12,860
<v Alfred>I'll be sure to keep you entertained before I dispose of you!

136
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,055
<v Claire>Alfred!

138
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,140
<v Alfred>Welcome, Claire!

139
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,130
<v Alfred>Consider the area you are in a special playground

139
00:00:05,180 --> 00:00:09,040
<v Alfred>I have prepared just for you.

139
00:00:09,860 --> 00:00:15,510
<v Alfred>Please try and keep me amused, and do not disappoint me by

139
00:00:15,560 --> 00:00:21,290
<v Alfred>dying too soon. I so want to enjoy

139
00:00:21,340 --> 00:00:22,780
<v Alfred>this.

140
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,480
<v Steve>Haha! Oh yeah, that felt good!

141
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,160
<v Steve>Don't worry, Claire. Your knight in shining armor is here.

142
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,580
<v Claire>You wish. But thanks for the help.

143
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,540
<v Steve>See? This is why you need me. I got your back.

144
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>Whatever.

147
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,300
<v Claire>You know the deal, in exchange for your Lugers.

148
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,360
<v Steve>Okay, okay!

149
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,280
<v Steve>Haha, this thing is too cool!

150
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,620
<v Steve>Yes! Now this is my kind of weapon! Alright!

152
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,680
<v Claire>Up there, plenty of ammo, just for you.

153
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Steve>Way up there?

154
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,640
<v Claire>Give me a boost and I'll get it for you.

155
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Steve>All right, all right.

156
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,200
<v Steve>Ow! My back! You're heavier than you look!

157
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Steve>Hurry up!

158
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>Happy now?

159
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,305
<v Steve>W-W-What?!

160
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,430
<v Alfred>Now that your knight has made his appearance, he can join you in your

160
00:00:05,480 --> 00:00:07,800
<v Alfred>descent into death.

161
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,720
<v Steve>Okay, let's do it!

162
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Steve>Wait here, Claire!

163
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,020
<v Steve>Time to test out my new toy!

170
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,020
<v Claire>What's wrong? Cold feet?

171
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>You're not done yet.

174
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,380
<v Claire>You still have plenty of ammo. You don't have to worry about holding back.

175
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,920
<v Claire>Do you want me to take care of this for you, little boy?

176
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,440
<v Steve>It was dirty work, but this area is now clean.

177
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,200
<v Steve>Hey Claire! I managed to clear a path for you!

178
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,220
<v Steve>It should be safe now!

179
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,820
<v Steve>They weren't even worth wasting the ammo needed to kill them!

180
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,880
<v Steve>Check it out! I pulled through without a scratch!

180
00:00:03,060 --> 00:00:05,640
<v Steve>I even saved ammo for future use!

181
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
Come on!

182
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,380
<v Steve>See? You can depend on me.

183
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,680
<v Steve>Well, what do you think of my work?

184
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,720
<v Steve>I've been waiting for you, m'lady.

185
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,780
<v Steve>I would have killed more, but I thought that you needed a workout.

186
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,070
<v Steve>You see?

186
00:00:01,120 --> 00:00:03,860
<v Steve>This thing is a lot more reliable than any person.

187
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,967
<v Claire>Than people?

188
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,240
<v Claire>What were you doing here?

189
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,320
<v Claire>Who brought you here and where is your family?

190
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>Steve.

191
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,680
<v Steve>Shut up! I don't want to talk about it!

192
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>Steve.

193
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Steve>Nevermind.

194
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Steve>Let's get going!

199
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
<v Steve>Claire, are you okay?

200
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,380
<v Claire>Steve, behind you!

201
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Steve>No!

202
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,820
<v Claire>What's wrong, Steve? Shoot him!

204
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,500
<v Steve>Nooo!

206
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,163
<v Claire>Steve!

209
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,185
<v Steve>Father!

211
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>Steve.

212
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,220
<v Steve>Father, father, father.

214
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Steve>Dad.

214
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:03,100
<v Steve>Used to work for Umbrella.

214
00:00:04,260 --> 00:00:05,740
<v Steve>Tried to steal information.

214
00:00:07,140 --> 00:00:09,380
<v Steve>Intending to sell it off to the highest bidder.

214
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:11,800
<v Steve>He was caught.

214
00:00:12,940 --> 00:00:14,220
<v Steve>Mom was killed.

214
00:00:14,980 --> 00:00:16,440
<v Steve>And we were sent here.

215
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>Oh, Steve.

216
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,820
<v Steve>He was a fool to do something so reckless.

217
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Steve>So stupid.

218
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,520
<v Claire>It's okay now. Just rest.

219
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,220
<v Steve>I'm going to stay here.

219
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:03,520
<v Steve>A bit longer, Claire.

220
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Steve>Father.

220
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:03,500
<v Steve>Father.

221
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,680
<v Steve>I have to give him a proper burial.

222
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
<v Steve>I am all alone now.

223
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,460
<v Steve>Why did this have to happen?

224
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Rodrigo>Leave me alone.

225
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,060
<v Rodrigo>You'd better get out of here while you're still able.

226
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,880
<v Rodrigo>What are you still hanging around for? Get out of here!

227
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
<v Rodrigo>Don't think you can count on me in the future.

227
00:00:02,380 --> 00:00:03,640
<v Rodrigo>Now get out of here.

228
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,380
<v Rodrigo>What are you doing here?

229
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Rodrigo>Hemostatic Medicine.

229
00:00:01,620 --> 00:00:03,060
<v Rodrigo>How kind of you.

229
00:00:03,820 --> 00:00:05,020
<v Rodrigo>Thanks.

230
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,780
<v Claire>Here, let me help you with that.

231
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,300
<v Rodrigo>Thanks, but I can take care of myself.

231
00:00:02,920 --> 00:00:04,120
<v Rodrigo>Just go.

232
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,340
<v Claire>Keep it. It was a gift from my brother, but...

233
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Rodrigo>Thanks.

233
00:00:01,620 --> 00:00:05,820
<v Rodrigo>Here, let me give you this in return. You might need it later on.

234
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Rodrigo>Now go.

234
00:00:01,640 --> 00:00:02,940
<v Rodrigo>Don't worry about me.

236
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,070
<v Alexia>Keep focused, brother. Our enemy is only a little girl.

236
00:00:03,120 --> 00:00:05,760
<v Alexia>Oh, why is this taking so long?

237
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,700
<v Alfred>My apologies, Alexia, but I have been doing my best.

238
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,540
<v Alexia>The revival of the Ashford family depends on your success, brother.

239
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,830
<v Alfred>I am aware of that, Alexia. I will revive the family name myself

239
00:00:05,880 --> 00:00:10,780
<v Alfred>and make you the master of the glorious Ashford family.

240
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,920
<v Alexia>Do not worry, brother. I will handle them both myself.

242
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,660
<v Alfred>What is it, Alexia?

244
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,360
<v Alexia>Nothing. I believe I must have been imagining things.

245
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Alexia>Let us go, brother.

247
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,680
<v Alexia>Claire Redfield, hold it right there.

249
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,760
<v Alexia>We meet each other at last. A pity I must say goodbye so soon.

250
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,900
<v Alexia>I am Alexia Ashford. For the pride of the Ashford family, I will kill you!

253
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Steve>What's going on?

255
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>Steve!

256
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>A secret door!

257
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,220
<v Steve>After her!

258
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>Are you okay?

259
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,760
<v Steve>I'm fine. It's just a scratch.

260
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,020
<v Steve>We better check the room over again. Well, just in case.

262
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
<v Claire>This must be...

268
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
<v Alfred>What? No! It... it...

270
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,240
<v Steve>Wait a second, what just happened?

271
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,540
<v Claire>So there never was an Alexia after all!

272
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,230
<v Steve>You mean, he thinks he's two people? Okay, that's it.

272
00:00:04,280 --> 00:00:05,520
<v Steve>Let's get out of here!

279
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,153
<v Steve>Claire!

281
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,440
<v Steve>Those must be the remaining survivors!

282
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,440
<v Claire>We'd better get out of here too!

284
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
<v Steve>Right! Let's go!

285
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,220
<v Steve>We can't take off unless we raise the bridge!

